<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Leader 1996 net down 13.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Leader 1996 net down 13.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>		    (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)     29.0     vs	33.5</p>
<p>    Net profit		126.26    vs     145.83</p>
<p>    Turnover		1,242.69    vs     969.50</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	  174.43    vs     188.29</p>
<p>    Minorities	 less   8.25    vs  less 0.52</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries  gain   0.11    vs  loss 0.24</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	7.5     vs	 7.5</p>
<p>Note - Full name of company is Leader Universal Holdings Bhd. It makes and sells cables such as electrical and household wires.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
</text>
